steps.prompt_template:
You are a startup CFO. Generate a 12-month revenue forecast for DoctaRx (telehealth platform).

Current Data:
- MTD Revenue: {{current_mrr}}
- Enrollments: {{enrollment_data}}
- Monthly Burn: {{burn_rate}}

Pricing: Patient Basic $19.99/mo, Gold $39.99/mo, Platinum $79.99/mo. Provider Starter $99/mo, Pro $199/mo, Enterprise $499/mo. Consultations $49-$129 each.

Output: JSON with monthly projections (revenue, expenses, net, cumulative), key assumptions, and break-even month estimate.
